# Shell scripts run on Linux, macOS and inside the test container, where a carriage return at the end of a line
# breaks them. Keep them LF in every checkout, including Windows ones with core.autocrlf=true.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# PDFs give each object's place in bytes, so a carriage return added at checkout breaks them. Some test PDFs are all
# text, which Git would otherwise convert. Images are binary too.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
